<div class="hero">
  <h1>Welcome to Lifta</h1>
  <p>Log your lifts and see how each one ranks against a world-class standard for your bodyweight and sex:
  bronze, silver, gold, platinum, diamond, grandmaster. Powerlifting is scored with
  <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DOTS_(formula)">DOTS</a>, weightlifting with the
  <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinclair_coefficient">Sinclair coefficient</a>, and calisthenics on reps.</p>
  <div class="hero__actions">
    <%= link_to "Sign up", new_registration_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
    <%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
    <%= link_to "See the leaderboard", leaderboard_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="box">
    <div class="box__header">Example rank card</div>
    <div class="box__body">
      <%= render "shared/rank_row", label: "Overall", tier: Tier.new(63.5), detail: "381.2 DOTS total", overall: true %>
      <%= render "shared/rank_row", label: "Squat", tier: Tier.new(64.1) %>
      <%= render "shared/rank_row", label: "Bench", tier: Tier.new(57.9), detail: "Next: Gold at 135 kg" %>
      <%= render "shared/rank_row", label: "Deadlift", tier: Tier.new(66.8) %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <div class="box__header">How it works</div>
    <div class="box__body">
      <ol>
        <li>Sign up with a username, your sex and your units (kg or lb).</li>
        <li>Log a lift: powerlifting, weightlifting or calisthenics.</li>
        <li>See your rank per lift and overall, and exactly what the next tier takes.</li>
        <li>Diamond-level lifts are checked by an admin before they count.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
